(# Proposed Technical Solution) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (The proposed system operates through the following technical process:) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1. **Traffic Data Collection:**) Tj
T* (   Traffic information is collected from roadside cameras, traffic sensors, connected devices, and) Tj
T* (historical traffic datasets.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (2. **Traffic Detection:**) Tj
T* (   Computer vision and sensor-processing techniques identify vehicles and estimate traffic) Tj
T* (parameters such as vehicle count, queue length, vehicle speed, lane occupancy, and traffic) Tj
T* (density.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (3. **Real-Time Traffic State Generation:**) Tj
T* (   The detected information is converted into a structured representation of the current traffic) Tj
T* (condition at each monitored intersection.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (4. **Traffic Prediction:**) Tj
T* (   A machine learning prediction module analyzes historical and real-time traffic patterns to) Tj
T* (estimate short-term future traffic conditions.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (5. **Congestion Assessment:**) Tj
T* (   The system calculates congestion indicators based on traffic density, queue length, waiting) Tj
T* (time, vehicle flow, and predicted demand.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (6. **Signal Optimization:**) Tj
T* (   An optimization engine determines suitable signal phase sequences and dynamically) Tj
T* (calculates green-light duration, red-light duration, and phase priorities.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (7. **Multi-Intersection Coordination:**) Tj
T* (   Traffic conditions from neighboring intersections are considered together to coordinate signal) Tj
T* (timings and reduce congestion propagation across connected roads.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (8. **Dynamic Signal Control:**) Tj
T* (   The optimized signal configuration is transmitted to the traffic signal controller.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (9. **Continuous Monitoring:**) Tj
T* (   The system continuously receives new traffic information and evaluates the effect of the) Tj
T* (current signal configuration.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (10. **Adaptive Reoptimization:**) Tj
T* (    When traffic conditions change, the system recalculates the traffic prediction and signal) Tj
T* (configuration, creating a continuous feedback loop between traffic sensing, prediction,) Tj
T* (optimization, and signal control.) Tj
ET
