(Novel Features Mapped) Tj
T* (Real-Time Multi-Parameter Traffic State Generation) Tj
T* (The system simultaneously evaluates vehicle density, queue length, lane occupancy, vehicle) Tj
T* (speed, traffic flow, and waiting time to generate a comprehensive real-time traffic state.) Tj
T* (Short-Term Traffic Prediction for Signal Control) Tj
T* (Instead of responding only to current traffic conditions, the system predicts near-future traffic) Tj
T* (demand using historical and real-time traffic data and uses the prediction during signal) Tj
T* (optimization.) Tj
T* (Predictive Congestion Prevention) Tj
T* (The system identifies traffic conditions that are likely to produce congestion and proactively) Tj
T* (modifies signal timings before excessive queue formation occurs.) Tj
T* (Dynamic Signal Phase Optimization) Tj
T* (Green duration, red duration, phase sequence, and phase priority are dynamically calculated) Tj
T* (according to changing traffic demand rather than relying on fixed timing configurations.) Tj
T* (Multi-Intersection Coordinated Optimization) Tj
T* (The system considers traffic conditions at neighboring intersections and coordinates signal) Tj
T* (timings across connected intersections to improve overall traffic flow.) Tj
T* (Continuous Feedback-Based Reoptimization) Tj
T* (After applying an optimized signal configuration, the system continuously measures the resulting) Tj
T* (traffic conditions and automatically reoptimizes the configuration when significant changes are) Tj
T* (detected.) Tj
T* (Real-Time Prediction-to-Control Feedback Loop) Tj
T* (␀T␀r␀a␀f␀f␀i␀c␀ ␀s␀e␀n␀s␀i␀n␀g␀ !’␀ ␀t␀r␀a␀f␀f␀i␀c␀-␀s␀t␀a␀t␀e␀ ␀g␀e␀n␀e␀r␀a␀t␀i␀o␀n␀ !’␀ ␀p␀r␀e␀d␀i␀c␀t␀i␀o␀n␀ !’␀ ␀c␀o␀n␀g␀e␀s␀t␀i␀o␀n␀ ␀a␀s␀s␀e␀s␀s␀m␀e␀n␀t␀ !’␀ ␀s␀i␀g␀n␀a␀l) Tj
T* (␀o␀p␀t␀i␀m␀i␀z␀a␀t␀i␀o␀n␀ !’␀ ␀s␀i␀g␀n␀a␀l␀ ␀c␀o␀n␀t␀r␀o␀l␀ !’␀ ␀p␀e␀r␀f␀o␀r␀m␀a␀n␀c␀e␀ ␀m␀o␀n␀i␀t␀o␀r␀i␀n␀g␀ !’␀ ␀r␀e␀o␀p␀t␀i␀m␀i␀z␀a␀t␀i␀o␀n␀ ␀f␀o␀r␀m␀s␀ ␀a␀ ␀c␀o␀n␀t␀i␀n␀u␀o␀u␀s) Tj
T* (automated control loop.) Tj
T* (Adaptive Response to Unexpected Traffic Changes) Tj
T* (The system can dynamically modify signal behavior when sudden traffic demand changes,) Tj
T* (unexpected queue formation, or localized congestion is detected.) Tj
T* (Network-Level Traffic Optimization) Tj
T* (The optimization objective can consider the combined condition of multiple interconnected) Tj
T* (intersections instead of optimizing each intersection independently.) Tj
T* (Integrated AI Traffic Decision Mechanism) Tj
T* (Traffic detection, prediction, congestion assessment, signal optimization, and feedback-based) Tj
T* (adaptation are integrated into a single intelligent decision-making framework.) Tj
